WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Now the code.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:05.197
The Microsoft 365 collector
makes three declared calls:

3
00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:08.063
messages, issues and health overviews.

4
00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:10.720
In a live run each is
a GET through the Graph

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.062
PowerShell request cmdlet;
in fixture mode it's a file.

6
00:00:14.062 --> 00:00:16.887
The posts and the issues become notices.

7
00:00:16.887 --> 00:00:21.462
The health overviews don't; they're kept
in the raw folder, for the run's record.

8
00:00:21.462 --> 00:00:26.405
And the source link of every record points
to the post or issue on the same host the

9
00:00:26.405 --> 00:00:31.420
kit read it from, so a task always links
back to what Microsoft actually published.
